# GNU Screen mechanics

This directory owns the imported GNU Screen 5.0.1 runtime mechanics used by
the native `screen` multicall module.

Boundary:

- `src/vendor/gnu/screen/` owns the terminal engine, ANSI parser, scheduler,
  layers, PTY, display, and related imported runtime mechanics.
- `src/applets/system/screen/` owns bx CLI parsing, defaults, diagnostics,
  session paths, OSC 52 policy, and exit-status policy.

Migration is intentionally incremental. A mechanics file moves here only when
its build and audit references move in the same change. Files must not be
copied back into the applet tree or wrapped by a duplicate implementation.

The snapshot entered bx in commit
`f01b07f8f98ab07773de3fc69f8f9ddfabf94bed`. Local compatibility and hardening
changes remain visible in normal repository history.
